{
  "1": {
    "title": "The Cuthbert Exception",
    "chapterCount": "1",
    "description": "<p class='indexstorydescription'>The first entry in the Rampage Sports anthology, it tells the story of how Middleweight competitors Britney Spears and Elisha Cuthbert first started down the road to becoming known as a single entity.  It also sets the precedent for how much control Richelle is really going to have over things.</p>",
    "chapters": [
					"The Cuthbert Exception"
				]
  },
  "2": {
    "title": "Stress Management",
    "chapterCount": "1",
    "description": "<p class='indexstorydescription'>After yet another tough loss in a string of bad results suffered by Steph McMahon causes her frustrations to boil over after an event.  This is the story of what happened next... and how team leader Danni Harris discovered Richelle is more than just a pretty face.</p>",
    "chapters": [
					"Stress Management"
				]
  },
  "3": {
    "title": "Surprising Steph",
    "chapterCount": "1",
    "description": "<p class='indexstorydescription'>Steph makes her first real impact in her new position as Fighter Development Coordinator for RSI.  And she wastes no time piercing through to the things that matter most to her stable owner.</p>",
    "chapters": [
					"Surprising Steph"
				]
  },
  "4": {
    "title": "Nightmare Relived",
    "chapterCount": "1",
    "description": "<p class='indexstorydescription'>Featherweight contender Tiffany Mulheron suffers a devastating loss at the hands of her most hated foe.  She walks out in frustration, leaving Richelle unsure if she's ever coming back.  When Tiff's training partner - Emma Watson - goes after her, no one has the slightest clue that it's the first of a series of events that will eventually lead to disaster.</p>",
    "chapters": [
					"Nightmare Relived"
				]
  },
  "5": {
    "title": "Emma Goes All In",
    "chapterCount": "1",
    "description": "<p class='indexstorydescription'>The mystery surrounding Tiffany and Emma is resolved... in a very unexpected way.  My goal in this story was to have Emma do something that would seem very out of character for her real life counterpart.  I have to admit, I accomplished it.  But the way I did it... well, let's just say that, if by some ridiculously slim chance Emma and I end up in the same place at the same time, she would have the right to punch me directly in the face.  And I should be forced to keep my hands at my sides and just take it.</p>",
    "chapters": [
					"Emma Goes All In"
				]
  },
  "6": {
    "title": "Unintended Consequences",
    "chapterCount": "8",
    "description": "<p class='indexstorydescription'>Richelle did such an awesome job fixing things in the last story that the situation has gone from bad to nearly hopeless.  The owner is prepared to do whatever it takes to make things right... and it costs her and her friends far more dearly than she ever could have expected.</p>",
    "chapters": [
					"Emma Gone Wild",
					"One Last Try",
					"The Last Option",
					"Into The Light",
					"Against Medical Advice",
					"All For One",
					"A Well-Deserved Beating",
					"The Blundering Idiot"
				]
  },
  "7": {
    "title": "Bigger Things",
    "chapterCount": "3",
    "description": "<p class='indexstorydescription'>While I know her message was SO much more important than my little RSI world, the way real life events played out made it seem as though Emma was giving me a good slap for the voyeuristic way I treated her character in <i>Emma Goes All In</i>.  Like she was saying, <i>Oh, you think that's funny?  Well, let me show you who I REALLY am.</i></p><p class='indexstorydescription'>Anyway... while I was busy playing amateur erotic novelist, the real Emma stepped up and showed the world exactly who they were dealing with.  The least important thing to come out of her speech before the United Nations was that it gave me the opportunity to make-up for the mess I'd made.  I was more than happy to take it.</p>",
    "chapters": [
					"A Day of No Rest",
					"A Show of Support",
					"An Offer Declined"
				]
  },
  "8": {
    "title": "The Friendship Test",
    "chapterCount": "23",
    "description": "<p class='indexstorydescription'>This is a story I co-wrote with the manager of a competing UMMA stable.  Early on, it's pretty obvious we didn't know exactly what we were doing.  But we figured it out as we went, and I think the final product is something we could both be proud of.  Oh, and we had a ton of fun putting it together, too.</p><p class='indexstorydescription'>Anyway... after another tough event for the <i>Dragon's Den</i> stable, stable leader Sophia Bush is left searching for ways she can get her group on the right track.  She gets the idea to seek advice from an old friend who happens to have just the kind of experience she needs.</p><p class='indexstorydescription'>The problem?  Well, it seems the friend she has in mind is very busy leading a competing stable.</p>",
    "chapters": [
					"Trouble on the HMNZS Dragon",
					"Desperate Times",
					"Desperate Measures",
					"A Strange Relationship",
					"Losing It",
					"Finding Focus",
					"Trying to Relate",
					"Time to Step Up",
					"Problem Number One",
					"Never Say Never",
					"Calling for Backup",
					"Two Steps Back",
					"Seeking Advice",
					"No Holding Back",
					"A Slight Misstep",
					"Dissolution",
					"A Basic Emotion",
					"Full Circle",
					"The Perfect Fit",
					"Driven to Distraction",
					"The End of the Beginning",
					"An Interesting Idea",
					"The New Way Forward"
				]
  },
  "9": {
    "title": "The Irish Temper",
    "chapterCount": "1",
    "description": "<p class='indexstorydescription'>The team leader of a competing stable had some nasty things to say about the women of RSI.  In this story, Richelle offers her response... and not all of it is in English.</p>",
    "chapters": [
					"The Irish Temper"
				]
  },
  "10": {
    "title": "A Chosen Leader",
    "chapterCount": "4",
    "description": "<p class='indexstorydescription'>As RSI prepares to create a third entry for the UMMA team competition, Richelle searches for the right person to lead the new group.  The only problem is that nobody seems to want the job.</p>",
    "chapters": [
					"Rejected... Again",
					"By A Jury Of Her Peers",
					"Challenge Accepted",
					"Time To Regroup"
				]
  },
  "11": {
    "title": "Driven To Win",
    "chapterCount": "3",
    "description": "<p class='indexstorydescription'>Emma Watson prepares to confront her biggest nemesis in the cage.  And she gets some very unexpected help with her prep work.</p>",
    "chapters": [
					"Secretly Annoyed",
					"Project Emma",
					"Game Time (illustrated by PhoenixCreed)"
				]
  },
  "12": {
    "title": "Girls Night, Gone Wrong",
    "chapterCount": "1",
    "description": "<p class='indexstorydescription'>Richelle and Danni try to go out for a friendly, casual dinner on a Friday night.  Could it really be that simple?  Not a chance.</p>",
    "chapters": [
					"Girls Night, Gone Wrong"
				]
  },
  "13": {
    "title": "A Puncher's Chance",
    "chapterCount": "1",
    "description": "<p class='indexstorydescription'>An RSI fighter gets destroyed in the cage.  The deflating feeling that comes from being beaten that way is something that has to be experienced to be understood... and it turns out Richelle understands it very well.</p><p class='indexstorydescription'>Meanwhile... it seems the fallout from Richelle's fight with Emma is worse than realized.  When current events force Danni to relive that nightmare, the truth makes its way out into the open.</p>",
    "chapters": [
					"Knockout From The Inside",
					"Knockout From The Inside, Redux",
					"The Membership Test",
					"Focus Lessons",
					"Target Practice",
					"A Gift For A Friend",
					"The Richelle Treatment"
				]
  },
  "14": {
    "title": "Middle Management",
    "chapterCount": "4",
    "description": "<p class='indexstorydescription'>Tough times beset the Middleweight Twins, Britney Spears and Elisha Cuthbert.  When frustation causes the two friends to turn on each other, Richelle and Danni concoct a plan to get them back on the same page.</p>",
    "chapters": [
					"Friendly Warfare",
					"Leveled",
					"Sister Act",
					"A Smashing Performance"
				]
  },
  "15": {
    "title": "The New Kid",
    "chapterCount": "1",
    "description": "<p class='indexstorydescription'>RSI brings in a fresh new face... one Richelle has had her eye on for a while.  Oh, and did I mention the new fighter hates Richelle's guts before she even walks through the front door?</p>",
    "chapters": [
					"The New Kid"
				]
  },
  "16": {
    "title": "Without Equal",
    "chapterCount": "3",
    "description": "<p class='indexstorydescription'>RSI's newest addition has gotten past her problems with Richelle and is starting to fit in nicely.  The problem?  There's no one on her level for her to train with.  The only solution is to recruit another fighter to be her training partner.  Only, as usual, Richelle can't keep things simple.  Instead, she embarks on a new experiment.  One that gives her an instant pain in her skull.</p>",
    "chapters": [
					"A Little Twist",
					"Moving On",
					"The Other Favorite"
				]
  },
  "17": {
    "title": "Haunted By The Past",
    "chapterCount": "37",
    "description": "<p class='indexstorydescription'>On a sunny, crisp winter morning, Danni walks into Richelle's office and abruptly hands in her resignation.  So begins the most dramatic and emotional saga Rampage Sports has ever been faced with.  Mobsters, private eyes, hitmen and mayhem.  RSI's owner and stable leader get sucked into a nightmare that will change them forever.  If they even manage to survive it.</p>",
    "chapters": [
					"Ruining a Good Day",
					"Role Reversal",
