  "18": {
    "title": "Trying Times",
    "chapterCount": "52",
    "description": "<p class='indexstorydescription'>The danger has passed.  The guilty have been punished.  And wouldn't you know?  Romance is in the air.</p><p class='indexstorydescription'>So, all is right with the world?</p><p class='indexstorydescription'><i>Blood and sweat sprayed from Danneel Harris's face as her opponent's fist slammed into the side of her head...</i></p><p class='indexstorydescription'>Nope.  Not even close.</p><p class='indexstorydescription'>It should come as no surprise that the developing relationship between Richelle and Danni would have its rough patches, but no one suspected how big a problem it would become... or just how much that distraction would cost.</p>",
    "chapters": [
